 "notes": "The shore entry at the dive centre and parking on the Kraaijenbergse Plassen near Beers, with the line and two reef balls out to the Kiekuut wreck (27 x 6 m, sunk March 2021, 11-12 m); wreck size and depth from duikeninbeeld.tv. Placed on the OpenStreetMap shore and the yellow buoys; positions are approximate, and the wreck sits about 50 m south-west of the site's own coordinates. The 3, 7 and 10 m contours are approximate; the sunken car and the small boat Daisy are not placed because their positions are not known. Shoreline from OpenStreetMap (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL).",
